# Eight threads calling into the library at once while it plays on
# the real clock: submit, mute, tempo, state, beat waits, clears.
# Nothing to compare but "done"; check_tsan is where it matters.
open realtime
tempo 1000
  prev: 120
track 1 60:1
  takes over at beat 0.000 (t0)
play continue
  was playing: 0
stress 1500
  done
